<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Indus</span></b> , a, um, adj., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰνδός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to India</i>, <i>Indian</i>
			(as an adj. almost exclusively <b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ebur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 12, 67</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dens,</span>”
				<i>ivory</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					64, 48</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">belua, i. e. elephas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Tr. 4, 6, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conchae,</span>”
				<i>pearls</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					1, 8, 39</span></i>
			 (1, 8 b. 13 M.).—<i>Plur.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Indi</span></b> ,
			ōrum, <i>the inhabitants of
				India</i>, <i>Indians</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Div.
				2, 46, 96</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">extremi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					11, 2</span></i>
			; Mela, 1, 2, 3 sq.; 3, 7?*!, 3.—In
			sing.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Indus</span></b> ,
				i, m.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>An Indian</i>, collect., <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 2,
				172</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. A. A. 3,
			130</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>An elephant</i>'<i>s driver</i>, <i>mahout</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 38,
				14, 2</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b> (<b>poet.</b>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>An Ethiopian</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 4,
				293</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>An Arabian</i> (sing. collect.), <i><span class="en">Ov. F. 3,
				720</span></i>.</div>
